---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CopyCommand from '../../components/CopyCommand.astro';
import { applications, registryStatus } from '../../data/project';

const installPackages = applications.map((app) => app.slug).join(' ');
---

<BaseLayout title="Install — Shared Pair" description="Final repository and package installation structure for Shared Pair.">
  <header class="page-hero shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">Install</p><h1>Commands ready.<br /><em>Repository pending.</em></h1><p class="lede">These are the intended public commands and URLs. Do not run them yet: <code>apt.sharedpair.dev</code> has not been promoted and verified.</p></div><div class="state"><span>Availability</span><strong>Not active</strong><small>Publication pending approval</small></div></header>
  <section class="steps shell">
    <article><span>01</span><div><h2>Add the signing key</h2><CopyCommand>curl -fsSL https://apt.sharedpair.dev/key.gpg | sudo gpg --dearmor --yes -o /usr/share/keyrings/sharedpair.gpg</CopyCommand></div></article>
    <article><span>02</span><div><h2>Add the repository</h2><CopyCommand>echo "deb [arch=amd64 signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/sharedpair.gpg] https://apt.sharedpair.dev resolute main" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/sharedpair.list</CopyCommand></div></article>
    <article><span>03</span><div><h2>Install applications</h2><CopyCommand>sudo apt update
sudo apt install {installPackages}</CopyCommand></div></article>
  </section>
  <section class="identity shell"><p class="eyebrow">Signing identity</p><dl><div><dt>Fingerprint</dt><dd>{registryStatus.signingFingerprint}</dd></div><div><dt>Suite</dt><dd>{registryStatus.suite}</dd></div><div><dt>Architecture</dt><dd>{registryStatus.architecture}</dd></div></dl><p>Verify the fingerprint independently before trusting repository metadata. These commands become active only after repository promotion and a fresh APT installation test.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  em { color: var(--lime); font-style: normal; }
  .page-hero { min-height: 44vh; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px; gap: 5vw; align-items: center; padding-block: 3.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .page-hero h1 { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.5vw, 5.8rem); }
  .state { padding: 1.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--violet); background: var(--surface); }
  .state span, .state small { display: block; color: var(--faint); font: .63rem var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .state strong { display: block; margin: .7rem 0; color: var(--violet); font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .steps { padding-block: 2.5rem; }
  article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.6rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  article > span { color: var(--violet); font: .68rem var(--mono); }
  h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.8rem); }
  .identity { padding-block: 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .identity dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr; }
  .identity dl div { padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  dt { color: var(--faint); font: .62rem var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
  dd { margin: .4rem 0 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font: .73rem var(--mono); }
  .identity > p:last-child { max-width: 780px; margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .page-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } article { grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr; } .identity dl { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
